# Build output an agent produced for an A/B comparison; it was swept into a
# commit by a broad `git add` and does not belong in the tree.
dist-baseline/

# Scratch probes. Verification agents write throwaway harnesses next to the
# real tools; one of them (_probe.mjs) duplicated smoke.mjs against the wrong
# port and read renderer.info, which measures the monster portrait rather than
# the game. Real tooling gets a real name and a docstring; scratch gets an
# underscore and stays out of the tree.
tools/_*.mjs
.DS_Store
